## ⚠️ Honest Limits

- **Not legal advice.** Nothing here is an opinion on whether a petition will be approved. Everything needs attorney review before filing.
- **It will not write your evidence.** Where something is missing it says missing. That is the point, not a limitation to work around.
- **Text only.** The page has no network access and cannot parse PDF or Word — open the document and paste the text.
- **Offline scores are heuristic.** They measure answer length, whether you named an exhibit, whether you gave comparative context and external evidence, and whether you fell back on forward-looking language. Useful signal, not an assessment.
- **Sessions live in one browser.** Export the report if it matters.

